    "name": "Choque de Cultura Racing",
    "steam_appid": 3614650,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choque Racing</strong> is a 3D racing game that blends adrenaline and humor, inspired by the world of Brazilian alternative transportation. Set in iconic locations in Rio de Janeiro and Esp\u00edrito Santo, players take the wheel as the legendary drivers Rogerinho do Ing\u00e1, Maur\u00edlio dos Anjos, Julinho da Van, and Renan de Almeida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional simulators, <i>Choque Racing</i> offers a free, chaotic experience where players can explore urban maps, pick up and drop off passengers, compete in thrilling races, and cause maximum mayhem. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Mode</strong> \u2013 Explore the city, collect passengers, and earn money to unlock new races and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Mode</strong> \u2013 Participate in structured races to prove your driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pega Mode</strong> \u2013 A casual street race to test your speed and reflexes in time-based challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced physics mechanics</strong> between arcade and simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world maps</strong> with multiple unlockable locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic characters</strong> from the <i>Choque de Cultura</i> show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-up system</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a satirical twist and references to Brazilian culture, <i>Choque Racing</i> delivers a wild and electrifying experience for those who love speed, humor, and a good challenge. Ready to hit the road and become the king of alternative racing?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choque Racing</strong> is a 3D racing game that blends adrenaline and humor, inspired by the world of Brazilian alternative transportation. Set in iconic locations in Rio de Janeiro and Esp\u00edrito Santo, players take the wheel as the legendary drivers Rogerinho do Ing\u00e1, Maur\u00edlio dos Anjos, Julinho da Van, and Renan de Almeida.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional simulators, <i>Choque Racing</i> offers a free, chaotic experience where players can explore urban maps, pick up and drop off passengers, compete in thrilling races, and cause maximum mayhem. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Game Modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Mode</strong> \u2013 Explore the city, collect passengers, and earn money to unlock new races and challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Circuit Mode</strong> \u2013 Participate in structured races to prove your driving skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pega Mode</strong> \u2013 A casual street race to test your speed and reflexes in time-based challenges.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Balanced physics mechanics</strong> between arcade and simulation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open-world maps</strong> with multiple unlockable locations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Iconic characters</strong> from the <i>Choque de Cultura</i> show.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power-up system</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a satirical twist and references to Brazilian culture, <i>Choque Racing</i> delivers a wild and electrifying experience for those who love speed, humor, and a good challenge. Ready to hit the road and become the king of alternative racing?</p>",
    "short_description": "Choque Racing is a chaotic and irreverent 3D racing game inspired by Brazilian alternative transportation. Take the wheel as Rogerinho, Julinho, Maur\u00edlio, and Renan, and dominate the streets in insane challenges. With multiplayer and iconic maps, the fun never stops!",
